<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>热点结合 on 📖 爱分享读书</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/categories/%E7%83%AD%E7%82%B9%E7%BB%93%E5%90%88/</link><description>Recent content in 热点结合 on 📖 爱分享读书</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 15:30:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://www.ishareread.com/categories/%E7%83%AD%E7%82%B9%E7%BB%93%E5%90%88/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>美联储3票反对加息、道指狂泻1153点、油价暴涨8%：翻开《剑桥中国史》才懂，全球市场每次“地震”，重复的都是同一个老故事</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E7%BE%8E%E8%81%94%E5%82%A83%E7%A5%A8%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E5%8A%A0%E6%81%AF%E9%81%93%E6%8C%87%E7%8B%82%E6%B3%BB1153%E7%82%B9%E6%B2%B9%E4%BB%B7%E6%9A%B4%E6%B6%A88%E7%BF%BB%E5%BC%80%E5%89%91%E6%A1%A5%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%8F%B2%E6%89%8D%E6%87%82%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E5%9C%B0%E9%9C%87%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E7%9A%84%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%80%81%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B/</link><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 15:30:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E7%BE%8E%E8%81%94%E5%82%A83%E7%A5%A8%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9%E5%8A%A0%E6%81%AF%E9%81%93%E6%8C%87%E7%8B%82%E6%B3%BB1153%E7%82%B9%E6%B2%B9%E4%BB%B7%E6%9A%B4%E6%B6%A88%E7%BF%BB%E5%BC%80%E5%89%91%E6%A1%A5%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%8F%B2%E6%89%8D%E6%87%82%E5%85%A8%E7%90%83%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E6%AF%8F%E6%AC%A1%E5%9C%B0%E9%9C%87%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E7%9A%84%E9%83%BD%E6%98%AF%E5%90%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E8%80%81%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;今天凌晨，全球金融市场上演了一出&amp;quot;三杀&amp;quot;大戏。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;美联储维持利率不变，但3张反对票创下十年纪录；道指暴跌1153点，创15个月最大单日跌幅；布伦特原油暴涨8%突破90美元/桶。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>反网络暴力法征求意见那天，我翻出斯蒂芬·金的旧书才想明白——真正的表达自由，不是想说就说</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E5%8F%8D%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E6%9A%B4%E5%8A%9B%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%81%E6%B1%82%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E9%82%A3%E5%A4%A9%E6%88%91%E7%BF%BB%E5%87%BA%E6%96%AF%E8%92%82%E8%8A%AC%E9%87%91%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A7%E4%B9%A6%E6%89%8D%E6%83%B3%E6%98%8E%E7%99%BD%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%83%B3%E8%AF%B4%E5%B0%B1%E8%AF%B4/</link><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 04:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E5%8F%8D%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E6%9A%B4%E5%8A%9B%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%81%E6%B1%82%E6%84%8F%E8%A7%81%E9%82%A3%E5%A4%A9%E6%88%91%E7%BF%BB%E5%87%BA%E6%96%AF%E8%92%82%E8%8A%AC%E9%87%91%E7%9A%84%E6%97%A7%E4%B9%A6%E6%89%8D%E6%83%B3%E6%98%8E%E7%99%BD%E7%9C%9F%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A8%E8%BE%BE%E8%87%AA%E7%94%B1%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E6%83%B3%E8%AF%B4%E5%B0%B1%E8%AF%B4/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.ishareread.com/" alt="Featured image of post 反网络暴力法征求意见那天，我翻出斯蒂芬·金的旧书才想明白——真正的表达自由，不是想说就说" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;昨天刷手机的时候，一条推送突然弹出来：&lt;strong&gt;《中华人民共和国反网络暴力法（征求意见稿）》正式公开征求意见了。&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我当时正靠在沙发上刷短视频，手指下意识停住了。不是被吓到，而是有一种&amp;quot;终于来了&amp;quot;的感觉。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>月之暗面估值一夜飙到500亿美元那天，我翻开一本30年前的历史书，突然看懂了一件事</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%9A%97%E9%9D%A2%E4%BC%B0%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%9C%E9%A3%99%E5%88%B0500%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%82%A3%E5%A4%A9%E6%88%91%E7%BF%BB%E5%BC%80%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%AC30%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E4%B9%A6%E7%AA%81%E7%84%B6%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B/</link><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E6%9C%88%E4%B9%8B%E6%9A%97%E9%9D%A2%E4%BC%B0%E5%80%BC%E4%B8%80%E5%A4%9C%E9%A3%99%E5%88%B0500%E4%BA%BF%E7%BE%8E%E5%85%83%E9%82%A3%E5%A4%A9%E6%88%91%E7%BF%BB%E5%BC%80%E4%B8%80%E6%9C%AC30%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E4%B9%A6%E7%AA%81%E7%84%B6%E7%9C%8B%E6%87%82%E4%BA%86%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.ishareread.com/" alt="Featured image of post 月之暗面估值一夜飙到500亿美元那天，我翻开一本30年前的历史书，突然看懂了一件事" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;昨天刷到一条新闻的时候，我正在地铁里。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;月之暗面完成了35亿美元F轮融资，投后估值350亿美元。原定8月才启动的Pre-IPO轮提前开跑，投前估值直接拉到500亿美元——折合人民币超过3300亿。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>创业板暴跌7.35%那天，全世界都在重复一个500年前的故事</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E5%88%9B%E4%B8%9A%E6%9D%BF%E6%9A%B4%E8%B7%8C7.35%E9%82%A3%E5%A4%A9%E5%85%A8%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA500%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B/</link><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E5%88%9B%E4%B8%9A%E6%9D%BF%E6%9A%B4%E8%B7%8C7.35%E9%82%A3%E5%A4%A9%E5%85%A8%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C%E9%83%BD%E5%9C%A8%E9%87%8D%E5%A4%8D%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA500%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E7%9A%84%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.ishareread.com/" alt="Featured image of post 创业板暴跌7.35%那天，全世界都在重复一个500年前的故事" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;昨天还在群里喊&amp;quot;牛市归来&amp;quot;的朋友，今天下午差点把手机摔了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;7月28日，A股上演了一场教科书级的&amp;quot;变脸&amp;quot;——前一天5200只个股普涨、创业板飙涨3.16%，不少人夜里美滋滋加了仓。结果第二天一开盘，创业板指暴跌7.35%，创一年多来最大单日跌幅，全市场2700只个股飘绿，科技股集体血洗。半导体板块跌超7%，光模块龙头跌超13%，单个芯片概念板块一天净流出280亿。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>东野圭吾走了，但他写的那些故事，400年前就有人给出过答案</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E4%B8%9C%E9%87%8E%E5%9C%AD%E5%90%BE%E8%B5%B0%E4%BA%86%E4%BD%86%E4%BB%96%E5%86%99%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E4%BA%9B%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B400%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%B0%B1%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%E8%BF%87%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 08:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E4%B8%9C%E9%87%8E%E5%9C%AD%E5%90%BE%E8%B5%B0%E4%BA%86%E4%BD%86%E4%BB%96%E5%86%99%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E4%BA%9B%E6%95%85%E4%BA%8B400%E5%B9%B4%E5%89%8D%E5%B0%B1%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%BA%E7%BB%99%E5%87%BA%E8%BF%87%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.ishareread.com/" alt="Featured image of post 东野圭吾走了，但他写的那些故事，400年前就有人给出过答案" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;昨天下午，我正在翻一本老书，手机突然弹出一条推送——&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;ldquo;日本推理作家东野圭吾于7月23日因大肠癌去世，享年68岁。&amp;rdquo;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我愣了好几秒。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>周星驰新片首日2亿、难看同时上热搜：乔布斯每年重读的那本书，写满了他25年只做一件事的答案</title><link>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E5%91%A8%E6%98%9F%E9%A9%B0%E6%96%B0%E7%89%87%E9%A6%96%E6%97%A52%E4%BA%BF%E9%9A%BE%E7%9C%8B%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8A%E7%83%AD%E6%90%9C%E4%B9%94%E5%B8%83%E6%96%AF%E6%AF%8F%E5%B9%B4%E9%87%8D%E8%AF%BB%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E6%9C%AC%E4%B9%A6%E5%86%99%E6%BB%A1%E4%BA%86%E4%BB%9625%E5%B9%B4%E5%8F%AA%E5%81%9A%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88/</link><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://www.ishareread.com/p/%E5%91%A8%E6%98%9F%E9%A9%B0%E6%96%B0%E7%89%87%E9%A6%96%E6%97%A52%E4%BA%BF%E9%9A%BE%E7%9C%8B%E5%90%8C%E6%97%B6%E4%B8%8A%E7%83%AD%E6%90%9C%E4%B9%94%E5%B8%83%E6%96%AF%E6%AF%8F%E5%B9%B4%E9%87%8D%E8%AF%BB%E7%9A%84%E9%82%A3%E6%9C%AC%E4%B9%A6%E5%86%99%E6%BB%A1%E4%BA%86%E4%BB%9625%E5%B9%B4%E5%8F%AA%E5%81%9A%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%B6%E4%BA%8B%E7%9A%84%E7%AD%94%E6%A1%88/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://www.ishareread.com/" alt="Featured image of post 周星驰新片首日2亿、难看同时上热搜：乔布斯每年重读的那本书，写满了他25年只做一件事的答案" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;昨天刷手机的时候，看到一条新闻直接把我看愣了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;《功夫女足》票房破20亿了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;更让我震惊的是另一条——豆瓣6.5分，猫眼9.4分。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;同一个电影，两个平台差了将近3分。评论区更是热闹得不行，一边有人说&amp;quot;笑到肚子疼，梦回少林足球&amp;quot;，另一边有人说&amp;quot;套路化、吃老本、难看&amp;quot;。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>